hadiths[31]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","He said, ""Yahya ibn Yahya al-Laythi related to me from Malik ibn Anas from Ibn Shihab that one day Umar ibn Abdal-Aziz delayed the prayer. Urwa ibn az-Zubayr came and told him that al-Mughira ibn Shuba had delayed the prayer one day while he was in Kufa and Abu Masud al- Ansari had come to him and said, 'What's this, Mughira? Don't you know that the angel Jibril came down and prayed and the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, prayed.' Then he prayed again, and the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, prayed. Then he prayed again, and the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, prayed. Then he prayed again, and the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, prayed. Then he prayed again, and the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, prayed. Then Jibril said, 'This is what you have been ordered to do.' Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz said, 'Be sure of what you relate, Urwa. Was it definitely Jibril who established the time of the prayer for the Messenger of Allah?' "" Urwa said, ""That's how it was related to Bashir ibn Abi Masud al-Ansari by his father"
"2","Urwa said that A'isha, the wife of the Prophet, may Allah bless him and grant him peace used to pray asr while the sunlight was pouring into her room, before the sun itself had become visible (i.e. because it was still high in the sky)"
"3","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Ata ibn Yasar said"
"4","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha"
"5","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar and from Busr ibn Said and from al-Araj-all of whom related it from Abu Hurayra - that the Messenger of Allah"
"6","And he narrated to me from Malik, from his uncle Abu Suhayl ibn Malik, from his father, that 'Umar ibn al-Khattab wrote to Abu Musa: \Pray Dhuhr when the sun declines"
"7","Yahya related to me from Malik, from Hisham ibn Urwah, from his father, that Umar ibn al-Khattab wrote to Abu Musa al-Ash'ari: \Pray the 'Asr prayer while the sun is white and clear"
"8","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that Umar ibn al-Khattab wrote to Abu Musa al-Ashari that he should pray asr when the sun was still pure white so that a man could ride three farsakhs (before maghrib) and that he should pray Isha during the first third of the night"
"9","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Ziyad that Abdullah ibn Rafi"
"10","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik said"
"11","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Anas ibn Malik said"
"12","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that al Qasim ibn Muhammad said"
"13","Yahya related to me from Malik from his uncle Abu Suhayl ibn Malik that his father said"
"14","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amr ibn Yahya ibn Yahya al- Mazini from Ibn Abi Salit that Uthman ibn Affan prayed jumua in Madina and asr in Malal (a place seventeen miles from Madina). Malik commented"
"15","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abdar-Rahman from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"16","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab used to say"
"17","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Umar and Zayd ibn Thabit used to say"
"18","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abu Hurayra used to say"
"19","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say"
"20","Yahya related to me from Malik that Da'ud ibn al-Husayn said that someone had told him Abdullah ibn Abbas used to say"
"21","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"22","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that once Umar ibn al-Khattab left after doing the asr prayer and met a man who had not been there. Umar asked him what had kept him from the prayer and eventhough the man gave a good reason"
"23","Yahya related to me from Malik thatYahya ibn Said used to say"
"24","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that one time Abdullah ibn Umar fainted and lost his senses and he did not make up the prayer. Malik commented"
"25","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"26","Yahya related to me from Malik that Zayd ibn Aslam said"
"27","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"28","Malik related to us from Abdullah ibn Yazid the mawla of al-Aswad ibn Sufyan"
"29","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"30","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"31","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Mujabbar that he used to see Salim ibn Abdullah pull the cloth away fiercely from the mouth of any man he saw covering his mouth while praying"
